-- Migration 0133: Expand Bangladesh Tuition & Residential Location Catalog (Phase 3)
-- Adds 183 vetted, high-demand residential, university, and tuition locations across Bangladesh:
-- - 154 sub-areas across existing supported cities: Dhaka (64), Chattogram (14), Sylhet (10), Rajshahi (9), Khulna (7), Barishal (6), Mymensingh (6), Rangpur (6), Cumilla (7), Gazipur (6), Narayanganj (7), Tangail (7), Sirajganj (5).
-- - 3 new major education cities + 26 sub-areas (29 items):
--   * Bogura (city + 11 areas: Jaleshwaritola, Shatmatha, Azizul Haque College Area, etc.)
--   * Jashore (city + 8 areas: JUST Campus Area, MM College Area, Palbari More, etc.)
--   * Kushtia (city + 7 areas: Islamic University Campus Area, Kushtia Govt College Area, NS Road, etc.)
-- Idempotent upsert ensures safe execution in existing environments.

ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
  `label` = VALUES(`label`),
  `type` = VALUES(`type`),
  `country` = VALUES(`country`),
  `parentId` = VALUES(`parentId`),
  `enabled` = VALUES(`enabled`),
  `origin` = VALUES(`origin`);
